<title>USA: A.T. Cross CFO leaving, Ruggieri named.</title>
<headline>A.T. Cross CFO leaving, Ruggieri named.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLN, RI 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.T. Cross Co said Wednesday that it had appointed John Ruggieri chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Ruggieri succeeds Michael El-Hillow, who is leaving the post to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Ruggieri has been with A.T. Cross for 16 years and had served as vice president of corporate planning and development and as executive vice president of the Mark Cross Inc subsidiary.</p>
</text>
